WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool. {cool de tsuyoku...}

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.{iketeru to...}

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all. {honto wa...}

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl! {futsuu ni...}

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid {puressha nank...}

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself. {sunao ni naritai...}

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character. {kyarajanai toka...}

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart! {atashi no kokoro...}

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you. {shugo kyara ga...}

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really! {zenzen...}

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be. {naritai...}

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring. {hitotsu...}

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it. {yaritai...}

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything! {nandatte...}

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...{kitto}

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be. {naritai atashi}

00:01:55.450 --> 00:01:57.030
What? Really?

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:58.620
Excuse me, girls.

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.330
Have you seen Hinamori-san around?

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:02.790
Hinamori-senpai?

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:03.740
Did you see her?

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:04.560
Nope.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.140
I see.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:07.560
Sorry to interrupt you.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.560
It was nothing at all.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.800
More to the right!

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:20.830
Celebration

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:20.830
The 2007

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:20.830
Seiyo Academy Gradation Ceremony

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.650
Or make that left!

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.680
Or right, I guess!

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:20.810
Give us proper instructions!

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:23.640
Th-That's easy for you to say!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:25.070
Are you okay, Yuiki-san?

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.040
Definitely not!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:30.240
I'm working so hard, when I'm the youngest one.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:33.310
Yet Amu-chi runs off while I'm not paying attention.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:34.150
And on top of that...

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:35.810
Over there!

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:37.710
But I'm graduating.

00:02:37.710 --> 00:02:39.450
That doesn't matter!

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.260
Help out!

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.220
That's not fair!

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.220
Fine. I get it. I get it.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:44.540
Bah.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:49.270
Helping prepare for your own graduation feels kind of...

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.890
Kukai-sama!

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.890
Soma-senpai!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.220
Soma-senpai!

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.870
Please give me a button off your uniform to remember you by!

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.120
I asked for one first!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.450
Who cares?

00:02:58.930 --> 00:02:59.880
Wait, wait!

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:00.850
Hold on a second!

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:01.810
Hold it.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:05.560
Could you girls cease your unsightly bickering?

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:07.060
To be fair,

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:10.780
why don't we hold an auction to determine ownership of the buttons?

00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:13.810
Taking into account the tight purses of you common folk,

00:03:13.810 --> 00:03:15.350
how about starting the bidding

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.060
at a mere 5,000 yen?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.420
Thank you so much!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.250
Yay!

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.160
What a relief.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.020
I'm so touched!

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:21.950
Huh?

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:22.790
See?

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:24.560
Just as I predicted.

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.270
Man, you really saved me.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:26.950
Um...

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:31.190
Tadase gave me a bunch of spare buttons so there wouldn't be a fight.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:31.770
What?

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:33.200
U-Um...

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.370
May I also have one?

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:36.860
Oh, sorry.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.120
I'm all out.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.140
Be strong, Saya-sama!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:43.100
Here.

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:43.830
Huh?

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:46.560
This is the last one off my jacket.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:52.030
Kukai-sama!

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.590
Whoa, don't jump on me!

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.990
Congratulations, Saya-sama!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.330
All's well that ends well.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.640
Good job.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.560
Yuiki-san!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:01.950
Well, fine!

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.430
I'm gonna have fun, too!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:06.350
What are you doing, Yaya?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:11.350
A New Beginning!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:11.350
Episode 26

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:15.850
The graduation ceremony is tomorrow.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.790
Nadeshiko just left,

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.930
and now Kukai's going, too.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:22.580
Jack.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:23.580
Queen.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:24.520
King.

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:25.430
Ace.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:26.680
Joker.

00:04:26.680 --> 00:04:29.430
The best group of five ever.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.310
But it's over.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.960
Everything, no matter how fun, has to end eventually.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:38.180
I guess that's how life is.

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.680
A-Amu-chan.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:43.260
Farewells are the only constant in life.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:45.160
So long, days of my youth.

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:46.820
A-Amu-chan is disappearing!

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:47.810
What do we do? What do we do?

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:49.680
Calm down, everyone!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:50.480
Come on.

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.400
Ah!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.760
K-Kukai!

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.750
Found someone skipping work.

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.850
N-No, I wasn't skipping.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:58.700
Oh well.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:04:59.850
Wanna skip together?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:00.850
Huh?

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:03.340
Wasn't she transparent a moment ago?

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.330
M-Maybe it was just your imagination?

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.520
Let's go.

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:12.180
Man, you're out of shape.

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.060
I did it!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.320
Now you've done it!

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:23.990
Hey!

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:27.010
Don't you think it's a little early to relax,

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.420
just because Nikaidou's had a change of heart?

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:29.800
Huh?

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:36.020
Easter could send a second or third member, someone even stronger.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.680
Yeah.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:39.980
Which is why,

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:42.680
to make sure we can deal with any enemy...

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.510
Kukai-style...

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.520
Golden Victory Shoot!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.080
Incredible.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:54.940
Hinamori!

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:55.470
Huh?

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.880
You're going to master this technique now!

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:01.350
It'll be Amulet Heart's new super move!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.950
Why do you get to decide that?

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:06.140
It'll be the final stage of your special training.

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:10.970
I got it.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:13.220
That's more like it!

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.020
This will be the last time I train with Kukai.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:27.850
He was the one who taught me about the Joker's special mission.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.970
To be honest, the training was hard.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.180
But it's funny...

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.810
When I realize that this is the last time,

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.580
I somehow think of it as fun.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.080
Wait, I take that back!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.060
Okay!

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:40.850
Last spurt!

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:42.720
Amu-chan.

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.430
Okay!

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.300
Let's join in.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.410
No, thank you.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.350
Okay!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.490
Go, Hinamori!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:58.930
Kukai-style...

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:02.370
Golden Victory Shoot!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.020
She's got the power.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:08.640
But her control...

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.380
Bonsai are definitely a core of the Japanese people.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.520
Hey!

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:20.460
Who did that?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:20.930
Oops.

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:22.740
The Vice Principal...

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:25.930
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.930
Ah.

00:07:25.930 --> 00:07:27.930
Wait up, that's dirty!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:31.550
That was close.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:32.130
Hey!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:39.240
I can't tell who's training who.

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:56.260
Everything, no matter how fun, has to end eventually, huh?

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:57.380
Yeah.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:01.100
It has to end?

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.570
I get the feeling nothing's really ended yet, though.

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:09.020
But once you graduate, you won't be a Guardian anymore, right?

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.680
Well, yeah, I guess.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.110
Aren't you sad?

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.520
Sure.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.470
But...

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.610
Forget it.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:20.190
I'm not very good at thinking too hard.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.600
Anyway, tomorrow's the spring graduation ceremony.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.430
Yeah.

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:26.990
If you don't see me off with a smile,

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:29.680
I'll be too worried to graduate.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.850
Honestly.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:50.640
After working so hard for the company,

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.950
they tell me to collect my belongings myself.

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.330
That's the life of a loser.

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:00.180
Man, you're harsh.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.410
But you know...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:08.300
I've completely lost interest in winning or losing.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:10.930
Working overtime again?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:14.310
If you push yourself too hard, you'll age faster.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.470
That's none of your business, Nikaidou-sensei.

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.430
Well, take care.

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:34.780
Come in.

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.080
Excuse me.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:40.770
We may have lost Nikaidou, but Sanjo-kun...

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:42.860
I expect great things from you.

00:09:42.860 --> 00:09:44.580
You can count on me.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:48.660
I will definitely find the Embryo for the Boss.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.780
Take care to maintain control as you use her.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:54.520
Control isn't an issue.

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.180
Utau is a caged bird.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.520
A mere puppet.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.540
She won't defy my orders.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:12.180
Ikuto!

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:14.900
Let's play! I'm bored!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.840
Ikuto-san, are you in your room?

00:10:22.900 --> 00:10:24.090
Ikuto-san.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.020
Please stop.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:51.960
What's wrong, girly?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.170
L-Let me go.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:55.760
It can't hurt to hang out with us a little.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.020
Hey there, fellows!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.270
What?

00:10:58.270 --> 00:11:00.060
Ah, my mistake.

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.140
The hell you lookin' at?

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:05.970
Wanna fight, kid?

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:12.150
Jeez, Amu-chan.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.860
Put a smile on that face.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.740
Not possible.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:19.970
I thought some window shopping might help cheer me up, but...

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:22.780
That was scary.

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:24.800
Is that boy going to be okay?

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:26.740
It's all thanks to him we were able to get away.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.560
I'm sure there's no need to worry.

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:31.470
He looked pretty strong, and nimble as a cat.

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:32.400
Cat?

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.230
I think I caught a glimpse of a knife on those guys.

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.220
You're kidding.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:40.220
It couldn't be...

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.350
Ikuto.

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:52.890
You okay?

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.680
Ikuto?

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.390
Blood?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.930
Oh, it's you.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.500
A-Are you hurt?

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.760
Don't be a pest.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:09.810
Get lost.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:12.680
Hey!

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.160
You're lame.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.680
You're like a real alley cat,

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:18.930
to fight in a place like this.

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:26.610
Ouch!

00:12:26.610 --> 00:12:27.600
S-Sorry!

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.310
Are you okay?

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:31.720
Just kidding.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:37.270
Jeez, you dummy!

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.270
Ouch. Hey!

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:43.100
Wh-What's going on here?

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.520
Head in lap!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.330
His head's in my lap, sure.

00:12:47.330 --> 00:12:49.180
But my knees hurt,

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:52.020
and his hair tickles.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.310
It reminds me of fur.

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:58.560
He's like a really big cat.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.590
He'd be pretty cute if he was always like this.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.020
Don't touch me in an erotic spot.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.760
Huh? Erotic?

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.570
My ears are sensitive.

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:10.020
Just like yours.

00:13:14.930 --> 00:13:15.520
Ow.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:16.590
Ikuto!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.020
Amu-chan.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.590
What're you doing?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.450
That hurt.

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.290
I shouldn't have been worried!

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:25.020
You must be fine if you can still sexually harass me!

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.740
This is concrete, you know.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.490
You really aren't cute.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.910
Okay.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:31.900
Let's go.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:32.640
Huh?

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:34.340
Follow me.

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:36.120
Your house is this way, right?

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.720
He's gonna walk you home.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:41.850
Whoa.

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.140
I've never gone down this street.

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:45.420
It's a shortcut.

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:50.180
This way next.

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.330
Okay.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.810
Go up here.

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:53.560
Up?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.350
All right, this is definitely

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:57.730
an alley cat's route!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:58.770
I said it was a shortcut.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.810
Fight!

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.390
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.060
You're overreacting.

00:14:03.060 --> 00:14:04.600
Calm yourself down.

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:07.020
Your state of mind is critical in times like this.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:09.370
So clear your mind of unnecessary thoughts,

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.550
and take deep breaths.

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.910
C-Caterpillar!

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.510
Amu-chan, I'm scared!{check timing}

00:14:17.110 --> 00:14:19.660
Get 'em away from me! {check timing}

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:20.430
You people sure are noisy.

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.010
We're here.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:26.110
Where?

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:29.350
Ouch.

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:37.350
Incredible!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.380
When you flip the breaker,

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.610
the power comes on for a bit.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.370
So there was an amusement park around here.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.890
It's going to be torn down, though.

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:01.880
Amu-chan!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.750
I wanna ride!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:03.560
Wanna play!

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:04.680
Wanna have fun!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.360
N-No!

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.060
Only babies get excited about amusement parks!

00:15:09.060 --> 00:15:11.860
I graduated from that stuff when I was three!

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:14.390
It's not like anybody's watching.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.530
Wanna go?

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:18.890
Let's go!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.250
What to ride? What to ride?

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:21.300
I wanna ride a horse!

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.740
A roller coaster!

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:24.640
I can't keep up with them.

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:32.340
Slowpoke!

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:33.740
What's that?

00:15:36.730 --> 00:15:39.480
Catch me if you can!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.470
Jeez! {check timing}

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:03.490
It's her third time on the merry-go-round.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:05.780
Amu-chan's tough.

00:16:05.780 --> 00:16:08.150
It must be nice to be a simple kid.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.700
I bet she doesn't have a care in the world.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:12.700
That's not true!

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:15.780
Amu-chan has plenty of worries of her own!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.270
Hey, people!

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:20.660
It's outrageous for young people to be chatting on the bench!

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.620
Come on, let's go!

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.080
Oh yeah...

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.300
You haven't been on a single ride.

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.250
It's fine.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.140
Watching you is already more than I can take.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:31.340
Ride something!

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:32.060
Huh?

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:33.080
You have to!

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:33.670
No.

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.770
Rock, paper, scissors, then!

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:35.560
If you lose, you have to ride.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:36.190
Okay?

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:37.120
Rock comes first!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:38.380
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.790
B-Best out of three!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:42.660
Huh?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:46.000
So lame!

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.050
This so isn't you!

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.610
That huge body in this little cup!

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.720
You're laughing too hard.

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:55.630
It's just hilarious.

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.150
I really let loose.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.580
I could never let my mom see me like this.

00:17:00.050 --> 00:17:01.330
Even though she's family?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.340
Yeah, I use an outside character at home, too.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:05.350
Outside character?

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.930
Or, I guess you could say a big sister character.

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.320
I have a little sister,

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.140
so I have to be responsible.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.880
Whenever we go to the amusement park,

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.700
we go to the attractions she likes.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:18.850
It's not like I hate my outside character...

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.030
But you know...

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:24.110
The truth is that there were a bunch of rides I wanted to try.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.680
Why am I spilling everything?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:30.840
W-Well, enough about me.

00:17:30.840 --> 00:17:32.190
You're strong.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:36.280
If I could create a character like that,

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.350
I might have it easier.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:43.500
We used to all come to this amusement park together.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.350
But it'll be gone soon.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.540
It'll end.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:53.740
The time for worrying about which ride to choose is coming to an end.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.440
The stuff Ikuto has on his mind,

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:01.750
and the problems he's facing,

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:04.600
are too hard for me to understand.

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.330
Still...

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:09.650
You know...

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:14.000
Today was my first time here.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:18.320
So, regardless of how many days are left for this amusement park,

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:21.300
today would be the beginning for me.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.020
So...

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:25.670
You should make today a new beginning, too.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:36.400
Huh?

00:18:36.400 --> 00:18:38.180
The breaker tripped.

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:45.990
Let's get going, Amu.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:48.720
Okay.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:04.340
You're still at the planetarium this late, Caretaker-san?

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:07.380
I mean, Founding King.

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:14.530
So do you have business here today?

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:17.680
Yes, I noticed something when I was reading the next alignment of the stars.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:21.740
The lock and key are drawing closer together,

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:27.180
and their brilliance is guiding the story to a new page.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:31.310
With a new Jack and a new Queen.

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.020
A new Jack and Queen?

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.540
Graduation Ceremony

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:06.830
Congratulations on Graduating!!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.210
Soma-kun.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.110
Kukai!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.620
You can't graduate!

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.290
Flunk a year!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.850
Don't be ridiculous.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:26.640
You can't go! You can't! You can't! You can't!

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:25.600
You were our oldest member.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:26.640
I'll be lonely without you.

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:31.220
May I talk to this picture when I'm troubled or uneasy?

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.990
Just call me on the phone, like normal.

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:33.710
Jeez!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.710
Stupid thing! Stupid thing!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:36.390
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:38.850
Give me back my diploma!

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:40.720
Everything, no matter how fun, has to end eventually.

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:43.220
That's what I thought.

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.190
But...

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.000
Okay.

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.720
I guess it's time to say good-bye.

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:50.800
What's with all the gloomy faces?

00:20:52.010 --> 00:20:55.430
I spent all of last night settling my thoughts.

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:56.180
Got it?

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:58.660
I'm about to say something awesome,

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:00.430
so keep your ears open.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.150
Fujisaki and I are leaving.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.830
But that doesn't mean it's over for the Guardians.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:08.720
Today will be...

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:10.720
A new beginning.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:14.000
It's not the end.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:15.330
Yep!

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:17.980
Nothing's over yet!

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:22.330
Not for Nadeshiko, or Kukai!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.270
Or Amu-chan, or anyone else!

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.470
A beginning...

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:31.020
We just have to make today a new beginning!

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:34.760
Hinamori!

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.180
You really are amusing.

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:37.470
You pass!

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:55.990
Let us hope that the new story will be a happy one.

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:09.370
Amu-chan!

00:22:09.370 --> 00:22:10.730
We're going on without you!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:13.580
Jeez!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:15.410
Wait up!

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always {sekai ga...}

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you! {suki da yo...}

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you! {suki suki suki...}

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living. {jitabata...}

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you! {kizukeyo...}

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you, {suki suki suki...}

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't! {iitaikuseni...}

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart! {tsutaetai...}

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero. {oh yes!...}

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.  {koishiterukagiri...}

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider? {hashitsuzukero...}

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger. {yuuyake...}

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth. {seishun no...}

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:51.180
It's spring!

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:51.950
April!

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:54.060
I, Hinamori Amu, have become a sixth-grader!

00:23:54.060 --> 00:23:55.820
Congrats, Amu-chan!

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:57.230
A new class.

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:58.580
And new friends!

00:23:58.580 --> 00:24:01.280
And there's one more new thing.

00:24:01.280 --> 00:24:02.600
What might that be?

00:24:02.600 --> 00:24:04.050
What, a quiz right off the bat?

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:05.520
Um, something new...

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:06.440
Uh, what is it...

00:24:06.440 --> 00:24:07.130
Um...

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:09.090
Boo! Time's up!

00:24:09.980 --> 00:24:11.400
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:13.030
The Fourth Guardian Egg!

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:14.830
Huh? A new Guardian Egg?

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:16.730
I wonder what'll hatch from it!

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:18.540
This might not be a good thing, you know.

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:19.410
What?!
